":"This includes developing a green gas tariff and projects to facilitate the increased use of renewable natural gas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/17/national-grid-plc-ngg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"NGG 2019 Q1","e":"ngg","d":"2019-05-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Pettigrew","x":"In summary, we're streamlining our operations, we're simplifying our supply chain, and we're rationalizing our property portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/17/national-grid-plc-ngg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"NGG 2019 Q1","e":"ngg","d":"2019-05-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Pettigrew","x":"Whilst early in the process, this program should deliver cost savings of around $30 million this year and $50 million in 2021.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/17/national-grid-plc-ngg-q1-2019-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"NGG 2020 Q1","e":"ngg","d":"2019-11-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andy Agg","x":"Finally, for the UK Transmission business as a whole, our cost efficiency program remains on track and we continue to expect cost savings of around GBP50 million in 2019, '20 and GBP100 million from 2020, '21 onwards.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/15/national-grid-plc-ngg-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"NGG 2020 Q1","e":"ngg","d":"2019-11-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andy Agg","x":"Our cost efficiency initiative is progressing well, and we continue to streamline operations, simplify our supply chain and rationalize our property portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/15/national-grid-plc-ngg-q1-2020-earnings-call-transc.aspx"},{"c":"NGG 2026 Q2","e":"ngg","d":"2025-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Pettigrew","x":"…taking to support load growth in the U.K. We're working with the government and industry, including U.S. big tech companies, as they seek to develop the U.K.'s AI infrastructure, including the creation of data centers within AI growth zones like the recently announced ones in and Cobalts Park.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/national-grid-ngg-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NGG 2026 Q2","e":"ngg","d":"2025-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"John Pettigrew","x":"We're now working hard to facilitate these connections, including working with the government through the AI Energy Council to support the development of more AI growth zones, so we can deliver the investment needed to meet growing energy requirements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/national-grid-ngg-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NGG 2026 Q2","e":"ngg","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Pettigrew","x":"We've also proposed a number of refinements to streamline our funding mechanisms, enable us to recover the efficient cost of our investments and progress projects at a pace expected by our stakeholders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/national-grid-ngg-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NGG 2026 Q2","e":"ngg","d":"2025-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"John Pettigrew","x":"I think we still like to see more done around the planning regime in the U.K. The planning legislation is going through, and I think that will streamline the process.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/national-grid-ngg-q2-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"NGG 2027 Q2","e":"ngg","d":"2026-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Andrew Agg","x":"So of course, we made allowances for future expected price increases as we flowed through that time line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/national-grid-ngg-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,10347,0,0,0,10137,96],[37,1,11452,0,0,0,11319,0],[39,1,12905,0